BlindPilot
==========

BlindPilot is an open-source, voice-first Android assistant for blind users.

This repository contains:

- A fork of Andclaw (https://github.com/andforce/Andclaw), MIT License.
- BlindPilot accessibility wrappers, server, safety engine, and public site.

Do not commit secrets. Device private keys stay on the phone.
Runtime cloud AI in production is Antigravity Agent only.
